SEE MSG-OUTBOX TRAINING
BEGIN_TEXT
Pick a message type, then fill in its boxes. Each type has its own guide
page with what goes in each box, and the box checks as you go: format,
precedence, addresses from the station book, date-time groups.

A message is sent only when it has no errors left. Frequencies are never
sent in the clear: name the channel by its designator.

Serial numbers are taken only when it is sent, so a message you drop
leaves no gap.
END
